* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs text eol=lf
*.csproj text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Archived release artifacts are evidence: their recorded SHA-256 is the whole point of keeping them,
# and any line-ending normalisation would make a checkout hash to something other than what the
# evidence claims. Store and check them out byte-for-byte.
evidence/rc/*/release-artifacts/** -text

# 白名单文档的副本按字节绑定 SHA-256（钉在 RiotCallAllowlistArchitectureTests 里），
# 行尾转换会让摘要漂移。整份 cp 自 8005-agv-program，不手工编辑。
vendor/8005-agv-program/** -text

# 切片家族表副本按字节绑定 SHA-256（钉在 ProtocolVectorTestBindingArchitectureTests 里），
# 行尾转换会让摘要漂移。整份 cp 自 8005-agv-protocol，不手工编辑。
vendor/8005-agv-protocol/** -text
